| Field              | Details                             |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| Case ID            | DAY43-001                           |
| Host               | Your lab computer, anonymized       |
| Time range         | Actual time range examined          |
| Event IDs          | IDs actually observed               |
| Account            | Anonymized account, if applicable   |
